content:
Retrieves the verification push result for the user with ID user_id . Push response
information will be available for 120 seconds after the push was sent, after which this
endpoint will return a 404. If no success or failure response was returned by this
endpoint during these 120 seconds, it can be assumed that the push has timed out.
Requires "Grant resource - Read" API permission.
{
"response": {
"confirmation_code": "123456",
"push_id": "123abc45-6def-789g-h012-34567ijk8901"
},
"stat": "OK"
}
GET  /admin/v1/users/[user_id]/verification_push_response
